<title>USA: Tosco Bayway shuts catcracker wed after leak.</title>
<headline>Tosco Bayway shuts catcracker wed after leak.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tosco Corp shut down the catalytic cracking unit at its 250,000 barrels per day (bpd) Bayway refinery on Wednesday after detecting a catalyst leak, a source close to the refinery said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's probably going to be down for two weeks; that's what the scenario looks like right now,&quot; the source said.</p>
</text>
